# Tobi caused by exhaustive draw noten payments takes precedence over a repeating dealer
# (engine.md §5 steps 1/3/5, rules.md §1 tobi_enabled, §4.29).
# East 1, dealer 0, scores: 35000 500 34500 30000.
# Exhaustive draw: only dealer Seat 0 is tenpai -> deltas: +3000 -1000 -1000 -1000.
# Post-round scores: 38000 -500 33500 29000.
# Seat 1 drops to -500 (< 0) -> Tobi ends the game immediately even though dealer Seat 0 is tenpai!
# Final ranks: 0, 2, 3, 1.
# Mahjong Soul adjusted scores (return 25000, oka 0, uma +15/+5/-5/-15):
#   S0 (1st): 38000 - 25000 + 15000 = +28000
#   S2 (2nd): 33500 - 25000 +  5000 = +13500
#   S3 (3rd): 29000 - 25000 -  5000 =  -1000
#   S1 (4th):  -500 - 25000 - 15000 = -40500

